  "description": "Research specification and deterministic reference transformation of caller-supplied JSON records into an evidence-bound continuity vector. The published package includes source v1.0.0 build _02, English academic companion edition academic-pdf-2, and a preserved Russian supplement. Primary evidence collection, admission, and truth verification remain outside the program. Empirical qualification remains NOT_ESTABLISHED. Component-specific rights apply; read the linked rights notice.",
